Cell["\<\
The energy-dependent upper and lower transformed hoppings are retained \
separately at complex energy. The upper coupling is not formed by conjugating \
the already transformed lower coupling.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->108704371,ExpressionUUID->"b81071e0-78ca-094c-961f-d509aea38ca6"],

Cell[TextData[{
